<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Request Submitted | Zahabia Travel & Tourism</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/brand/LOGO123.png">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/app.css">
  <style>
    .auth-page { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f4f7f6 0%, #e8f0ed 100%); padding: 2rem 1rem; }
    .success-card { width: 100%; max-width: 500px; background: #fff; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); padding: 3rem 2rem; text-align: center; }
    .success-icon { font-size: 4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .success-card h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; color: var(--primary-dark); }
    .success-card p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .steps { text-align: left; background: #f0f7f5; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 1.2rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; }
    .steps h3 { font-size: 0.85rem; margin: 0 0 0.8rem; color: var(--primary-dark); }
    .steps ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8; }
    .btn-group { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; margin-top: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="auth-page">
    <div class="success-card">
      <div class="success-icon">✅</div>
      <h1>Flight Request Submitted!</h1>
      <p>Thank you! Our team has received your flight request and will get back to you shortly with the best available options.</p>
      <div class="steps">
        <h3>What Happens Next?</h3>
        <ol>
          <li>Our team reviews available flights</li>
          <li>You receive a quote via email & WhatsApp</li>
          <li>Approve the itinerary and make payment</li>
          <li>Receive your e-ticket instantly</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-group">
        <a href="/flights/request" class="btn btn-primary">Submit Another Request</a>
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary">Back to Home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
